---
layout: base.njk
title: Ridgeway Services
description: A general website structure with a polished landing page layout.
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-slideshow" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="hero-slide hero-slide-1 is-active"></div>
    <div class="hero-slide hero-slide-2"></div>
    <div class="hero-slide hero-slide-3"></div>
    <div class="hero-slide hero-slide-4"></div>
    <div class="hero-slide hero-slide-5"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="container hero-content">
    <h1>Commercial & Residential Construction Across Ontario</h1>
    <p class="eyebrow">Integrity | Teamwork | Tradition</p>
    <p>
      Ridgeway Services & Construction delivers high-quality commercial construction solutions with integrity,
      collaboration, and a commitment to excellence.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/projects/">View Our Work</a>
      <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/contact/">Contact Us</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-breadcrumbs" aria-label="Project gallery">
      <button class="hero-breadcrumb active" type="button" aria-label="Show slide 1"></button>
      <button class="hero-breadcrumb" type="button" aria-label="Show slide 2"></button>
      <button class="hero-breadcrumb" type="button" aria-label="Show slide 3"></button>
      <button class="hero-breadcrumb" type="button" aria-label="Show slide 4"></button>
      <button class="hero-breadcrumb" type="button" aria-label="Show slide 5"></button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="about" class="section section-full">
  <div class="container" data-reveal-group>
    <div class="sub-title primary" data-reveal>Our Services</div>
    <h2 data-reveal>What We Do</h2>
    <p data-reveal>End-to-end construction services tailored to your space, schedule and budget</p>

      <div class="services-container" data-reveal>
          <div class="card-container">
              <div class="box">
                <a href="/services/design-build" class="card-link">
                  <div class="icon">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined">design_services</span>
                  </div>

                  <h3>Design-Build Services</h3>

                  <p>
                    Collaborative planning and design to streamline your project from concept to completion.
                  </p>

                  <span class="learn-more">
                    Learn More
                    <span class="arrow">→</span>
                  </span>
                </a>
              </div>

              <div class="box">
                <a href="/services/construction" class="card-link">
                  <div class="icon">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined">home_repair_service</span>
                  </div>

                  <h3>Construction</h3>

                  <p>
                    Transforming existing spaces to meet your business needs with minimal disruption.
                  </p>

                  <span class="learn-more">
                    Learn More
                    <span class="arrow">→</span>
                  </span>
                </a>
              </div>

              <div class="box">
                <a href="/services/project-management" class="card-link">
                  <div class="icon">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined">assignment</span>
                  </div>

                  <h3>Project Management</h3>

                  <p>
                  Dedicated project management to ensure quality, timelines, and budgets are met.
                  </p>

                  <span class="learn-more">
                    Learn More
                    <span class="arrow">→</span>
                  </span>
                </a>
              </div>

              <div class="box">
                <a href="/services/maintenance" class="card-link">
                  <div class="icon">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined">handyman</span>
                  </div>

                  <h3>Maintenance & Repairs</h3>

                  <p>
                  Reliable maintenance and repair services to keep your spaces running smoothly.
                  </p>

                  <span class="learn-more">
                    Learn More
                    <span class="arrow">→</span>
                  </span>
                </a>
              </div>
          </div>
      </div>
  </div>
</section>

